        "text": "HushOS\n\nSecurity notice\n\n\nTwo-step sign-in is on.\n\nSigning in to your account now asks for a second step after your password. Keep your backup codes somewhere safe, apart from your password.\n\nOpen your account {{accountUrl}}\n\nWhen\n\n{{when}}\n\nSecond step\n\n{{method}}\n\nIf you didn’t do this, someone else is signed in to your account. Remove any device you don’t recognise and change your password. These notices can’t be turned off. {{accountUrl}}"
