        "text": "HushOS\n\nSecurity notice\n\n\nYour recovery phrase was used for the second step.\n\nYour recovery phrase was used in place of your second step. If you have lost your authenticator app or your backup codes, remove them from your account and set them up again.\n\nOpen your account {{accountUrl}}\n\nWhen\n\n{{when}}\n\nKeep the phrase apart from your password: whoever has both can sign in. If this wasn’t you, change your password and make a new recovery phrase. These notices can’t be turned off. {{accountUrl}}"
