        "text": "HushOS\n\nSecurity notice\n\n\nAuthenticator codes are paused for new devices.\n\nAfter 100 wrong codes in a row, HushOS stopped taking authenticator codes from devices that have not signed in to your account before. Devices you already use are not affected.\n\nOpen your account {{accountUrl}}\n\nWhen\n\n{{when}}\n\nTo sign in on a new device, use a backup code or your recovery phrase; either one switches authenticator codes back on. If it wasn’t you entering codes, change your password. These notices can’t be turned off. {{accountUrl}}"
